            0.822,
            0.399
          ],
          "content": "**Very open-ended Go for BIG ideas! (No such thing as “failure.” Empirically driven building on foundational insights.)**"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "bbox": [
            0.064,
            0.464,
            0.933,
            0.901
          ],
          "sub_type": "code",
          "content": "```txt\nE.g.\nCan you evolve a language from scratch?\nCan you learn from “reading”? (E.g. game play from text on discussion boards)\nMechanical Turk --- Human-computing hybrids\nMine info from twitter feeds\nBoost game play via “mimicry”\n```",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": []
